# Shell scripts and the Python bridge are deployed to the Raspberry Pi (Linux) by
# scp'ing the working-copy file directly. Force LF so a Windows checkout never
# rewrites them to CRLF — bash chokes on `\r` (e.g. tools/restart_bridge_safe.sh),
# and a CRLF shebang line silently breaks the guarded restart.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
